{
  "info": {
    "name": "PFE - Lot 4 Bloc B - Commentaires (etape 4.8)",
    "description": "Collection de test pour CommentaireController (Lot 4, bloc B). Executer les dossiers dans l'ordre : 0. Auth, 1. Mise en place, 2. Commentaires - Document, 3. Commentaires - Jalon, 4. Cas limites. Collection independante de Lot4-BlocA-Documents (elle recree son propre projet/jalon/document).\n\nComptes utilises :\n- Encadrant : karim.benali@pfe.local / Encadrant@2026\n- Etudiant (chef d'equipe attendu) : yassine.alami@pfe.local / Etudiant@2026, sinon sara.bennani@pfe.local / Etudiant@2026 (verifier via 'Equipe du projet', comme aux collections precedentes)\n- Etudiant (non chef, sert au test 403) : l'autre des deux comptes ci-dessus, celui qui n'est PAS le chef\n\nRegle testee : seuls le chef d'equipe et l'encadrant du projet peuvent deposer un commentaire ; tout autre compte authentifie peut les lire.\n\nLa requete 'Upload document lie au jalon' necessite d'attacher un fichier manuellement dans Body > form-data (champ 'fichier'), comme dans la collection Bloc A.\n\nPrerequis : docker compose up -d (minio), ddl-auto=update (table commentaire creee automatiquement).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8081" },
    { "key": "tokenEncadrant", "value": "" },
    { "key": "tokenEtudiantChef", "value": "" },
    { "key": "tokenEtudiantAutre", "value": "" },
    { "key": "emailEtudiantChef", "value": "yassine.alami@pfe.local" },
    { "key": "motDePasseEtudiantChef", "value": "Etudiant@2026" },
    { "key": "emailEtudiantAutre", "value": "sara.bennani@pfe.local" },
    { "key": "motDePasseEtudiantAutre", "value": "Etudiant@2026" },
    { "key": "projetId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "equipeId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "etapeId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "documentId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "documentJetableId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login encadrant (karim.benali)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"karim.benali@pfe.local\",\n  \"motDePasse\": \"Encadrant@2026\"\n}" }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenEncadrant', data.accessToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login etudiant chef d'equipe attendu",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{emailEtudiantChef}}\",\n  \"motDePasse\": \"{{motDePasseEtudiantChef}}\"\n}" }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenEtudiantChef', data.accessToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login etudiant autre (non chef attendu)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{emailEtudiantAutre}}\",\n  \"motDePasse\": \"{{motDePasseEtudiantAutre}}\"\n}" }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenEtudiantAutre', data.accessToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Mise en place",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Mon projet (etudiant chef) -> capture projetId/equipeId",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEtudiantChef}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projets/moi", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "projets", "moi"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('projetId', data.id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('equipeId', data.equipeId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Equipe du projet (verifier le chef)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/equipes/{{equipeId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "equipes", "{{equipeId}}"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "console.log('chefNom =', data.chefNom, '(doit correspondre a emailEtudiantChef ; sinon inverser emailEtudiantChef/emailEtudiantAutre et refaire les logins)');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Creer un jalon (encadrant) -> capture etapeId",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projets/{{projetId}}/etapes", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "projets", "{{projetId}}", "etapes"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"titre\": \"Jalon test commentaires\",\n  \"description\": \"Jalon cree pour tester les commentaires (lot 4, bloc B)\",\n  \"dateEcheance\": \"2026-10-15\",\n  \"ordre\": 2\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('etapeId', data.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload document lie au jalon -> capture documentId",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEtudiantChef}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projets/{{projetId}}/documents?etapeId={{etapeId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "projets", "{{projetId}}", "documents"],
              "query": [{ "key": "etapeId", "value": "{{etapeId}}" }]
            },
            "body": { "mode": "formdata", "formdata": [{ "key": "fichier", "type": "file", "src": [] }] },
            "description": "Attacher un fichier dans Body > form-data (champ 'fichier') avant d'envoyer."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('documentId', data.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload document jetable (pour le test 'document supprime') -> capture documentJetableId",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEtudiantChef}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projets/{{projetId}}/documents",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "projets", "{{projetId}}", "documents"]
            },
            "body": { "mode": "formdata", "formdata": [{ "key": "fichier", "type": "file", "src": [] }] },
            "description": "Attacher un fichier different de celui du document precedent (pas de query etapeId, document general). Sera supprime juste apres pour tester le 404."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('documentJetableId', data.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Supprimer le document jetable (encadrant)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentJetableId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "documents", "{{documentJetableId}}"] }
          },
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('204 No Content', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"] } }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Commentaires - Document",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Lister commentaires du document (vide au depart)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/commentaires", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "documents", "{{documentId}}", "commentaires"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('liste vide', () => pm.expect(data.length).to.eql(0));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Commenter le document (encadrant)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/commentaires", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "documents", "{{documentId}}", "commentaires"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"contenu\": \"Bon depart, attention a la section 3.\"\n}" }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('documentId correct', () => pm.expect(data.documentId).to.eql(parseInt(pm.collectionVariables.get('documentId'))));",
                  "pm.test('etapeId absent', () => pm.expect(data.etapeId).to.be.null);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Commenter le document (etudiant chef)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEtudiantChef}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/commentaires", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "documents", "{{documentId}}", "commentaires"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"contenu\": \"Corrige, merci pour la remarque.\"\n}" }
          },
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"] } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Commenter le document (etudiant non participant -> 403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEtudiantAutre}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/commentaires", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "documents", "{{documentId}}", "commentaires"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"contenu\": \"Ne doit pas passer si je ne suis pas le chef d'equipe.\"\n}" }
          },
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('403 Forbidden (pas chef ni encadrant)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"] } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Commenter le document avec contenu vide (attendu 400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/commentaires", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "documents", "{{documentId}}", "commentaires"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"contenu\": \"\"\n}" }
          },
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('400 Bad Request (validation)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"] } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Lister commentaires du document (2 attendus)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEtudiantAutre}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/commentaires", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "documents", "{{documentId}}", "commentaires"] },
            "description": "Lecture testee avec le compte 'non participant' : la consultation reste ouverte a tout compte authentifie."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('2 commentaires, ordre chronologique croissant', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(data.length).to.eql(2);",
                  "  pm.expect(new Date(data[0].dateCreation).getTime()).to.be.at.most(new Date(data[1].dateCreation).getTime());",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Commentaires - Jalon",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Lister commentaires du jalon (vide au depart)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/etapes/{{etapeId}}/commentaires", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "etapes", "{{etapeId}}", "commentaires"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('liste vide', () => pm.expect(data.length).to.eql(0));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Commenter le jalon (etudiant chef)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEtudiantChef}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/etapes/{{etapeId}}/commentaires", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "etapes", "{{etapeId}}", "commentaires"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"contenu\": \"On vise la soumission pour vendredi.\"\n}" }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('etapeId correct', () => pm.expect(data.etapeId).to.eql(parseInt(pm.collectionVariables.get('etapeId'))));",
                  "pm.test('documentId absent', () => pm.expect(data.documentId).to.be.null);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Commenter le jalon (encadrant)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/etapes/{{etapeId}}/commentaires", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "etapes", "{{etapeId}}", "commentaires"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"contenu\": \"Ok pour vendredi, pensez a inclure les tests.\"\n}" }
          },
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"] } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Commenter le jalon (etudiant non participant -> 403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEtudiantAutre}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/etapes/{{etapeId}}/commentaires", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "etapes", "{{etapeId}}", "commentaires"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"contenu\": \"Ne doit pas passer.\"\n}" }
          },
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('403 Forbidden (pas chef ni encadrant)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"] } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Lister commentaires du jalon (2 attendus)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/etapes/{{etapeId}}/commentaires", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "etapes", "{{etapeId}}", "commentaires"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('2 commentaires', () => pm.expect(data.length).to.eql(2));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Cas limites",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Commenter un document inexistant (attendu 404)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/documents/999999/commentaires", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "documents", "999999", "commentaires"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"contenu\": \"Test document inexistant\"\n}" }
          },
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('404 Not Found', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"] } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Commenter un jalon inexistant (attendu 404)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/etapes/999999/commentaires", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "etapes", "999999", "commentaires"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"contenu\": \"Test jalon inexistant\"\n}" }
          },
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('404 Not Found', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"] } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Commenter un document supprime logiquement (attendu 404)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentJetableId}}/commentaires", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "documents", "{{documentJetableId}}", "commentaires"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"contenu\": \"Ne doit pas passer, document deja supprime.\"\n}" }
          },
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('404 Not Found (document supprime)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"] } }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
